<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan ICBC 1996 sales up 22.52 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan ICBC 1996 sales up 22.52 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's International Commercial Bank of China said on Tuesday its 1996 sales revenues totalled T$38.139 billion, up 22.52 percent from 1995.</p>
<p>In December alone, the bank's sales were T$4.359 billion, rising 52.3 percent from December 1995, a company statement said.</p>
<p>It did not give profit figures.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
